      "comment": "OPTIMIZING (5) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts four wins. Comes off a (22.58) win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths in a Grade 5 over 400m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. KING ZEAL (3) has hit the frame here at the last two runs, most recently finishing second beaten 0.8 lengths (22.78). Got the money at his only try from this box. Leading chance. SPANISH BROOK (1) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, weakening late to finish a 3 length fourth (22.94) over 400m at this track. Likely to play a prominent role. BOTH BULLETS (8) returns here with a good chance to improve on last time.",
